# Explainability

Example

Today's session emphasizes heavy carries and unilateral pulling because wrestling performance depends on maintaining force production while controlling an external load in unstable positions.

Grip endurance intervals are included because prolonged grip control strongly influences clinch dominance and takedown success.

Explosive penetration-step drills improve lower-body power transfer into offensive attacks.

